# Real hosts this deployment may test: the infrastructure key. Copy to deploy/approved-hosts.txt (not committed).
# The platform, the worker and the egress proxy read it read-only at start; restart them together after a change:
#   ./scripts/apply-approved-hosts.sh
#
# One host per line, exact name, optional port (443 when none), who approved it and the change that did:
#   staging.example.com:443  approved-by=ops@example.com  change=CHG-1042  reason=Pilot of the billing portal
#
# No wildcards, no IP addresses. Approving a host does not let anything run on its own: an Organization Admin must
# also record the environment's written authorization, with its expiry, in QAutoEngine.
